Kind: ablation
Issue: #664
Takes out: CR0.WP on the boot processor, for the moment its own SMEP, SMAP and CR0.WP probes run and on no other processor -- the census has already read CR0 with WP on, so the probe is asked for, and the store through the read-only mapping goes through; before #664 the boot processor's probes were never judged and this was not caught
Run: --entry 0 600 -smp 4
Expect: processor 0 wrote through a read-only mapping

